intro:
  heading: "Professional Asphalt Paving Throughout Massachusetts"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      For more than 35 years, S. Phaneuf & Associates has provided professional asphalt paving services for residential and commercial properties throughout Massachusetts. We install and improve driveways, parking lots, private roads, and other paved surfaces, with an emphasis on proper preparation, quality workmanship, and long-term pavement performance.
    - >
      Every project begins with thoughtful planning and careful evaluation of the property. Proper site preparation, grading, drainage, and base construction are critical to creating asphalt pavement that can withstand vehicle traffic, changing weather, and Massachusetts freeze-thaw conditions. Our team considers the existing site, intended use, drainage requirements, and overall project goals before recommending the appropriate paving solution.
    - >
      Our asphalt paving services include new driveway and parking lot installation, private road paving, asphalt repairs, resurfacing, milling, maintenance, and related site preparation. We work with homeowners, businesses, property owners, and other customers throughout Massachusetts, and can coordinate paving with excavation, grading, drainage, and broader site development projects when needed.
    - >
      Whether you are replacing an aging residential driveway, constructing a new commercial parking lot, improving a private road, or addressing deteriorating pavement, S. Phaneuf & Associates can evaluate your property and help determine the right approach for a durable, functional asphalt surface.
 


